{"id":"vod_sn_37167","vodId":"37167","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"美妙天堂","name_cn":"美妙天堂","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/90f9c8a41b4a47d7fbe2a22652495be2.jpg"},"summary":"某一天，一封招待信送到一群少女们的手中。这个招待信可不一般，那是融合了时尚、舞蹈、音乐等的孩子梦想的“美妙天堂”世界入场券。在那儿，每天都可以参加唱歌、跳舞、时尚的竞赛，而比赛实况也将通过电视和网络向全世界播出。如今的顶级偶像也都是从“美妙天堂”当中诞生的。主角啦啦和他的朋友们也对于“美妙天堂”的世界充满兴趣。不过啦啦的学校却禁止小学生参加这些活动……然而，因为一次奇妙的契机，啦啦第一次走进这个传说中的世界，结果还登上了比赛的舞台。那么啦啦的“美妙天堂”出道演出究竟会如何呢！？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:49:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":38,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bG5k8JT5ZQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1GKP3z3SFZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c8SzsPFStQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xQ9uuM1Pw11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RBzmFJ3zTx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/m0MvyqguUq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/a7UXMi2p3e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fiBC93zBJs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xVatwHNRes1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/U9MvLHDGKy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M0tXgN5fyg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7ZqY9qpcF21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ehr05zgWiY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3VCXqEQ6Cw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pwdTX7i6